==== the registry
upstream
community
==== the catalog
community/browser  A browser, from the second collection (requires flatpak)
upstream/browser  A browser, from the first collection
upstream/custom-kernel  A kernel the image pins, swapped in over the base's own
upstream/debian-family  apt and its state directories, which every deb build layer reaches for
upstream/fedora-family  dnf5 and its plugins, which every fedora build layer reaches for
upstream/flatpak  Flatpak client and a daily update timer
upstream/needs-family  A module that needs the family adapter under it (requires build-environment)
upstream/signature-policy  Sigstore signature verification for the image's own updates
